  <prompt>
    Promote the NFR-06 tenant-pin verification from task 012 into a standing integration test: assert that under
    NDA-REVIEW's execution tenant, grounding retrieval returns non-zero chunks from the seeded NDA standard — so a
    future tenant/filter change that silently zeroes grounding fails CI instead of shipping.
  </prompt>

  <role>
    SPAARKE AI test engineer. Expert in ReferenceRetrievalService grounding + the Azure AI Search tenant filter.
  </role>

  <goal>
    An integration test asserts non-zero grounding chunks for the NDA standard under the execution tenant; it fails
    if the tenant pin regresses.
  </goal>

  <context>
    <background>
      NFR-06: reference docs seeded tenantId="system"; retrieval filters context.TenantId. Task 012 verified/fixed
      the pin; this test makes it durable. Filter on documentType (post-rename), not domain.
    </background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Ai/ReferenceRetrievalService.cs</file>
      <file>tests/integration/ (grounding tenant-pin)</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>012 (pin verified/fixed + standard seeded).</dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="NFR-06">The test asserts non-zero retrieved chunks for the seeded NDA standard under the execution tenant; a zero result is a hard failure.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">KEEP-path integration test; no banned mock patterns.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <files>
      <file>.claude/patterns/ai/node-executor-authoring.md</file>
      <file>docs/adr/ADR-038-testing-strategy.md</file>
      <file>docs/standards/TEST-ARCHITECTURE.md</file>
    </files>
  </knowledge>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Author an integration test that runs grounding retrieval for the NDA standard under NDA-REVIEW's execution tenant.</step>
    <step order="2">Assert the result is non-zero and includes a chunk from the seeded standard source.</step>
    <step order="3">Confirm the test fails if the tenant filter or source tenant is changed to a mismatch.</step>
    <step order="4">Run the test; update TASK-INDEX.md: mark 052 ✅.</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>
    <tool name="dotnet">Run integration tests.</tool>
  </tools>

  <outputs>
    <output type="test">tests/integration/ (grounding tenant-pin, NFR-06)</output>
  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Given NDA-REVIEW's execution tenant, when grounding runs, then retrieval returns non-zero chunks including the seeded NDA standard.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given a simulated tenant/filter mismatch, when the test runs, then it fails (regression guard proven).</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>
    Durable guard for the project's highest-risk silent failure mode.
  </notes>

